{"version":1,"content":"<p>馬來西亞政府周三（21日）以國家安全及保護個人資料為由，禁止公務員在執行公務時使用源自以色列的導航應用程式Waze，首相安華呼籲民眾改用本土導航程式TuJu。</p><p>不過，部分民眾認為，TuJu在路線搜尋及車載系統的相容性仍有不足，導航畫面不穩定，路線指示亦不夠精確。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:41:23.786182+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:26:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:20.930114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:37:43.697620+00:00","content_hash":"b9591c89fa1969282a331d7b26604c25fb03525403c6186cedfb50c9175dfc7e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}